### Legacy public reads — what landing-ui calls today (LegacyContentApi, @Deprecated). Shapes unchanged.

### Pages list (count = page size)
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&count=20

### Page by code
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/pages/about-us?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Page by per-language friendly URL
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/pages/name/about-us?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Boxes the storefront reads
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/boxes/header-message?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/boxes/meta-title?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/boxes/meta-description?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

###
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/content/api/v1/content/boxes/agreement?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}

### Legacy alias through the merchant prefix (Caddy @legacy_content) still lands here
GET {{SELLER_UI_URL}}/spg/merchant/api/v1/content/pages?store={{STORE_ID}}&pod={{POD_ID}}&lang={{LANG}}&page=0&count=20
